      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Innovative drug delivery systems have been developed for nifedipine and clonidine that prolong the pharmacologic activity of the medications, allowing once daily dosing. The nifedipine-GITS (gastrointestinal therapeutic system) tablet formulation and the clonidine-TTS (transcutaneous delivery system) patch may also reduce side effects in patients while preserving the therapeutic efficacy of the origin drug formulations (nifedipie capsule, clonidine tablet)."},
